Z||000000||FieroHeather||09-09-2001||07:30 PM||||I got to drive Grinthock's 87 GT back to the hotel!!! (A 20 min drive)<P>So I didnt get to drink myself silly, BUT I got to be the driver instead of the passenger!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Banditbalz's wedding was soooooo much fun!  Too bad there were only <B>three</B> Fieros there!!  Ya'll missed a great time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000001||Mach10||09-09-2001||07:34 PM||||Disadvantages: Puke on your upholstery. Beer looks better going down, than coming up. ESPECIALLY on 25c Wings night  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>CURE: Take someone else's car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>No longer a passenger for the night, eh?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||7
Z||000002||banditbalz||09-09-2001||08:52 PM||||The reception was balls of fun! SlammedFiero and Grinthock were there. The drive home was a blast. Will have pics to share with the forum, including closeups of SlammedFieros 11.25" brakes. This car stops so fast it is scary! Thanks for coming out FieroHeather, we had a great time with you guys.<BR>Anyways, have a plane to catch in a few hours....<P>_<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackwhite2_1.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||12
Z||000003||FieroHeather||09-10-2001||10:03 AM||||Lucky them!! Banditbalz and his new wife are going to Florida for their honeymoon--and one of the places they get to go is Disney World!!!  <P>Have a safe trip  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Yeah, watching SlammedFiero's sweet red Fiero, and Grinthock's and Banditbalz's silver Fieros glide down the road was awesome!!  If only I had a video camera to catch the action, eh?  <P>But, I got my privilaged moment of glory after the reception when I got to drive Grinthock's fiero back to our rooms.  The rest of the people in our group had already made it back to the beachfront motel (which was BEAUTIFUL) by the time Grinthock and I pulled in.  They were sitting on the deck watching us arrive, and they *knew* that it had to be me driving, cause I took it easy around the corner, and pulled into the parking spot gently.  Im very NICE to the car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">  I dont gunn it around corners or whip into parking spots like 3 OTHER drivers I know!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
